cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use crypto-service-sdk-go in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "crypto-service-sdk-go: a typed Go client for the Crypto Service REST API"
abstract: >-
  A Go client for the Crypto Service REST API (crypto-server), which
  provides hashing, authenticated encryption, server-held signing keys,
  post-quantum key encapsulation and signatures, HPKE and KMS
  operations. The client implements no cryptography itself and is held
  to the conformance kit shared by every Crypto Service client.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
version: "0.0.40"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
